<title>FINLAND: AKTIA BANK CUTS PRIME RATE TO 4.0 PCT FROM 4.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>AKTIA BANK CUTS PRIME RATE TO 4.0 PCT FROM 4.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Aktia Saastopankki said in a statement on Wednesday it would lower its prime rate to 4.00 percent from 4.50 percent effective September 16.</p>
<p>The lowering of the prime rate was based on the fall in market interest rates and moderate inflation expectations, Aktia said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
